{"seq":1,"slug":"an-athenian-aristocrat","title":"An Athenian Aristocrat","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times/an-athenian-aristocrat","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"birth-and-family","title":"出身与家世","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times/an-athenian-aristocrat/birth-and-family","wordCount":1982,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"youth-and-ambition","title":"青年与抱负","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/plato/life-and-times/an-athenian-aristocrat/youth-and-ambition","wordCount":1834,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章追溯柏拉图的出身、家世与青年抱负。柏拉图出身于雅典最显赫的贵族家庭，有着深厚的政治世家渊源，成长于伯罗奔尼撒战争的动荡时代。青年柏拉图本怀有从政的抱负，然而，现实的幻灭与苏格拉底的影响，最终使他放弃从政，转向哲学。本章呈现&quot;雅典贵族&quot;柏拉图的早年生命与人生转向的起点。</p>\n"}